    "title": "Next steps for displaced employees of MLily factory fire - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Deric Rush ,\n13 hours ago FAIRFIELD COUNTY, S.C. (WIS) - What comes next for the hundreds of workers displaced by the catastrophic mattress factory fire in Winnsboro?. That is the question dominating Fairfield County as emergency crews shift from battling flames to dousing residual hot spots at the destroyed Healthcare S.C. plant (formerly referenced as MLily USA). While local and state agencies have jumped into action to coordinate transition plans, displaced employees say they are still waiting for crucial answers from company management. Read full article\n2",
